        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.97m x 2.21m\n\n\nHallway - 5.22m 1.82m\n\n\nLiving Room - 7.19m x 4.54m\n\n\nKitchen - 2.81m x 3.35m\n\n\nDining Room - 3.97m x 3.36m\n\n\nHallway - 1.20m x 1.32m\n\n\nGuest WC - 0.96m x 1.32m\n\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.30m x 4.49m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.31m x 3.57m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.18m x 2.63m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.16m x 2.24m\n\n\n"
